  "job_B3.5.13_20251003_114754": {
    "text": "Men \u00f0a leofestan, us ys mycel \u00feearf \u00fe\u00e6t we God lufien of eallre heortan & of eallre sawle & of eallum\nSo\u00f0lice dryhten \u00e6lmihtig \u00fee eallu \u00feing gesceop ys ure lif & ure h\u00e6lo & ure hiht, & he is ure gefea & he\nUton, men \u00fea leofestan, georne leornian eadmodnesse \u00feurh \u00fea we magon Gode geneal\u00e6can, & uton us\n& warnien \u00fea rican \u00feysse worulde \u00feone cwide \u00fee be him awriten ys, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea rican swa mycle maran\n& warnige ure gehwylc hine & georne nu ongyte gehwylc ure hw\u00e6t be \u00f0am earmum synfullum ys on\nButan hie \u00e6r hiera ended\u00e6ge to Gode gecyrron, butan tweon \u00e6fter hyra geononsi\u00f0e hie to helle witum\nMen \u00f0a leofestan, hw\u00e6t froma\u00fe \u00e6nigum menn \u00fe\u00e6t he f\u00e6ste & \u00fe\u00e6t he hyne forh\u00e6bbe fram fl\u00e6sce &\nUton us \u00e6t Gode \u00fea mihta biddan.\n& m\u00e6nig ys on eor\u00f0an we witon, men \u00fea leofestan, swa earm \u00fe\u00e6t he wat lyt hw\u00e6t he o\u00f0erum sylle,\n& hitt ys \u00feeahhw\u00e6\u00f0ere awriten on Cristes bocum hu he sylf her on worulde l\u00e6rde & s\u00e6de be \u00f0\u00e6re\nEalle he tosomne gecigde, ge \u00feone eadigran ge \u00feone earmeran, \u00fe\u00e6t we ealle sceolon \u00e6lmessan syllan\n& symle we sceolon biddan Godes mildheortnesse mid orm\u00e6ttre geomrunge & mid syngalum gebedum\n& uton a amang o\u00f0erum godum worcum \u00e6lmyssan don, for \u00f0am seo \u00e6lmessylen alyst \u00feone synfullan\nMen \u00fea leofestan, uton efestan & uton gan \u00feurh Godes wegas.\n\u00de\u00e6t synt so\u00f0lice Godes wegas: riht geleafa & gewiss hiht & fulfremed so\u00f0 lufu & \u00feurhwunung on\nMen \u00f0a leofestan, uton us nu ymbscrydan & gefr\u00e6tuwian mid godum weorcum & mid m\u00e6genum urum\n\u00de\u00e6t fyrmeste m\u00e6gen \u00fe\u00e6re sawle ys \u00fe\u00e6t we lufien urne ecan God of eallre ure heortan & of eallre sawle\n\u00deonne ys \u00fe\u00e6t o\u00f0er m\u00e6gen \u00fe\u00e6re sawle \u00fe\u00e6t man fylige ge\u00feylde & forbuge \u00e6lc unriht yrre.\n\u00deonne ys \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feridde m\u00e6gen \u00fe\u00e6re sawle \u00fe\u00e6t man gehealde cl\u00e6nnesse \u00e6g\u00f0er ge lichoman ge sawle &\n\u00deonne ys \u00fe\u00e6t feor\u00f0e m\u00e6gen \u00fe\u00e6re sawle \u00fe\u00e6t man forhycge idelwuldor & forseo ealle gewitendlicu \u00feing.\n\u00deonne is \u00fe\u00e6t fifte m\u00e6gen \u00fe\u00e6re sawle \u00fe\u00e6t man bega ea\u00f0modnesse & onscunige ofermodignesse.\n\u00de\u00e6t syxte m\u00e6gen \u00fe\u00e6re sawle ys \u00fe\u00e6t man lufie so\u00f0f\u00e6stnesse & forfleo \u00e6lce leasunga.\n\u00de\u00e6t seofo\u00f0e m\u00e6gen \u00fe\u00e6re sawle ys \u00fe\u00e6t se man hine forh\u00e6bbe fram yrre & fram hatheortnesse.\n\u00de\u00e6t eahto\u00f0e m\u00e6gen ys \u00fe\u00e6re sawle \u00fe\u00e6t man lufie sybbe & onsceonige hatunge.\n\u00de\u00e6t nigo\u00f0e m\u00e6gen \u00fe\u00e6re sawle is \u00fe\u00e6t man forbuge \u00e6lce disignesse & lufie godcundne wisdom.\n\u00de\u00e6t teo\u00f0e m\u00e6gen \u00fe\u00e6re sawle ys \u00fe\u00e6t man aweg aweorpe of \u00f0am mode ealne \u00feone yflan lust \u00fe\u00e6s\n\u00de\u00e6t endlyfte m\u00e6gen \u00fe\u00e6re sawle ys \u00fe\u00e6t man forhycge gytsunge & genime wilsume \u00feearflicnesse.\n\u00d0onne ys \u00fe\u00e6t twelfte m\u00e6gen \u00fe\u00e6re sawle \u00fe\u00e6t man h\u00e6bbe Godes so\u00f0an lufe & ure nehstena, & na \u00fe\u00e6t\n\u00d0ys synt \u00fea twelf m\u00e6genu.\nOf \u00f0am beo\u00f0 ymbscridde eallra rihtwisra manna sawla on domes d\u00e6ge, & of \u00feam hie scina\u00f0 beforan\nMen \u00f0a leofestan, \u00feas m\u00e6genu we magon begytan gyf we toforan asetta\u00fe \u00f0a heofonlican \u00feing eallum\nUton eac ge\u00feencan georne, men \u00f0a leofestan, mid arf\u00e6stum & mid wellwillendum mode hu dryhten\n& na \u00fe\u00e6t an \u00fe\u00e6t he us \u00feanon alysde, men \u00f0a leofestan, ac eac swylce he us behet \u00fea ecan meda \u00fe\u00e6s\nUton efstan nu \u00fe\u00e6t we magon him gewrixl agyldan on swa myclum swa he us gefultumian wille\nUton ne agildan yfel ongean his god, ac on swa myclum swa we magon uton hycgan \u00fe\u00e6t we\nUton bringan & offrian dryhtne, urum alysende, halige lac, \u00e6ryst \u00fe\u00e6t we gehealdon on him rihtne\n\u00d0as gifa & \u00feas lac syndon \u00feancwyr\u00f0e & well gecweme urum dryhtne, & witodlice gif hie beo\u00f0 him\n\u00d0ig we eow bidda\u00f0 & myndgia\u00f0 & eac halsia\u00f0 \u00feurh \u00feone \u00fee us alysde ealle mid his \u00f0am deorwyr\u00f0an\n& uton ealle geornlicor be urra sawla h\u00e6lo ge\u00feencan \u00feonne we \u00e6r \u00feyssum dydon, & na to \u00fe\u00e6s hwon\n& eft he cw\u00e6\u00f0: eadige beo\u00f0 \u00fea mildheortan, for\u00f0am\u00fee hie begyta\u00fe mildheortnesse.\n& eft he cw\u00e6\u00f0: eadige beo\u00f0 \u00fea cl\u00e6nheortan, for\u00f0am\u00fee hie geseo\u00f0 God.\nWitodlice we cuma\u00f0 orsorge on domes d\u00e6ge toforan Cristes \u00ferymsetle, & beo\u00f0 rihtwise \u00feonne on\n& we beo\u00f0 fram him for\u00f0 gecigede to \u00feam heofonlican gebeorscipe mid \u00feam m\u00e6rum heahf\u00e6derum\nHe us gegearwa\u00f0 \u00fea heofonlican for \u00f0am eor\u00f0licum & \u00fea ecan \u00feing for \u00feam hwilendlicum \u00feingum\nMen \u00fea leofestan, we sceolon ongytan gleawlice on urum mode \u00fe\u00e6t God gesceop \u00feone fyrmystan\n\u00dei we syndon deadlice men & to duste sceolon on worulde wyr\u00f0an, wyrmum to \u00e6te, & of eor\u00f0an\nBeo\u00f0 \u00feonne mid urum sawlum symle ece earme o\u00f0\u00f0e eadige, swa hw\u00e6\u00f0er swa we her on worulde \u00e6r\nNu we sculon efestan gif we a willa\u00f0 \u00feone uplican e\u00f0el secan & urum sawlum gebeorgan.\nWe sceolon symle herian heofones God, se us healde\u00f0 a wi\u00f0 feonda gehw\u00e6ne, gif we hine so\u00f0f\u00e6stlice\nWitudlice he syl\u00f0 \u00feam ece blisse, earmum ge eadigum, \u00fee hyt geearnia\u00f0.\n\u00dei we eow l\u00e6ra\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t ge eow wi\u00f0 unrihth\u00e6med georne beorgen, & ge scylda\u00f0 eow wi\u00f0 \u00fea bealewan\n\u00deurh oferhygednesse englas wurdon iu forsceapene to deoflum & bescofene eac on helle grund, \u00fe\u00e6r\nAc him se r\u00e6d ne ge\u00feah, ac se sti\u00f0moda cyning, dryhten \u00e6lmihtig, awearp of \u00f0am setle \u00feone modigan\nHie wiston \u00fee geornor, witum besette on \u00fe\u00e6re byrnendan helle, wi\u00f0 hw\u00e6ne hie winnan ongunnon.\nAc uton beon ea\u00f0mode & \u00e6lmesgeorne & wise on wordum & on d\u00e6dum eac, & uton bli\u00f0um mode on\nFor\u00fean \u00fe\u00e6t halige gebed & seo hluttre lufu Godes \u00e6lmihtiges & seo \u00e6lmessylen \u00fee man for Gode\nMen \u00fea leofestan, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0e we ger\u00e6d habba\u00f0 & geleornod on haligum bocum se ytemesta d\u00e6g \u00feysse\nOn \u00feam d\u00e6ge \u00fea hleo\u00f0riendan liggeas forb\u00e6rna\u00f0 \u00feone blodgemengdan middangeard & \u00feonne \u00fee nu\nOn \u00f0am d\u00e6ge \u00fe\u00e6s myclan domes, gewit sunnan leoht & monan leoht & \u00fea leoht eallra tungla.\nOn \u00f0am d\u00e6ge dryhtnes rod by\u00f0 blode flowende betweox wolcnum, & on \u00f0am d\u00e6ge by\u00f0 dryhtnes\nOn \u00feam d\u00e6ge \u00fea synfullan heofa\u00f0 & wepa\u00f0, for\u00f0an \u00fee hie \u00e6r noldan hyra synna betan, ac hie \u00feonne\nOn \u00f0am d\u00e6ge, feower englas blawa\u00f0 feower byman on feower healfa \u00feysses middangeardes & \u00feonne\nOn \u00f0am d\u00e6ge sitt ure dryhten on his myclan m\u00ebgen\u00ferymme & his ansyne \u00e6tywe\u00f0, & \u00feonne Iudeas\n& se so\u00f0f\u00e6sta dema \u00f0onne deme\u00f0 eallra manna gehwylcum be his agenum gewyrhtum.\nHw\u00e6t la, \u00fe\u00e6t ys ofer eallu \u00feing to smeagenne \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea earman fyrenfullan sceolon sarie asw\u00e6man fram\nEala \u00fe\u00e6t menn him eallinga ne ondr\u00e6da\u00f0 hu \u00f0a deoflu him onst\u00e6la\u00f0 ealle \u00fea unrihtan weorc \u00fee her\nEala hw\u00e6t, men him ne ondr\u00e6da\u00f0 \u00feone deofol Antecrist mid helle witum & his yrm\u00f0um & his \u00f0am\nEala hw\u00e6t, we us ne ondr\u00e6da\u00f0 \u00feone toweardan ege \u00fe\u00e6s domes d\u00e6ges, se ys yrm\u00f0e d\u00e6g &\nOn \u00f0am d\u00e6ge us by\u00f0 \u00e6tywed se gesewena heofon & engla \u00ferym & eallwihtna hryre & eor\u00f0an\nOn \u00feam d\u00e6ge us by\u00f0 \u00e6lc \u00feylic egesa \u00e6tywed.\n\u00de\u00e6r \u00fea fyrenfullan \u00feonne mihton gewiscean \u00fe\u00e6t hie n\u00e6fre n\u00e6ron acennede fram hira f\u00e6derum &\nHw\u00e6t, him \u00feonne \u00fe\u00e6t w\u00e6re leofre \u00feonne eall middangeard mid \u00feam gestreonum \u00fee heofon\nLa hw\u00e6t, we us ne ondr\u00e6da\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t we d\u00e6ghwamlice geseo\u00f0 beforan urum eagun ure neahstan sweltan,\nHw\u00e6t, \u00fe\u00e6t bi\u00f0 \u00feonne sarlic sar & earmlic gedal \u00fe\u00e6s lichoman & \u00fe\u00e6re sawle, gif \u00feonne se earma\nAc uton beon gemyndige urra sawla \u00feearfa, & uton wyrcan god on \u00feam \u00fee we \u00feurhteon magon, & uto\n& uton lufian urne dryhten mid eallum mode & mid eallum m\u00e6gene & mid eallre heortan hyldo &\n& uton lufian ure neahstan, \u00fe\u00e6t syndon ealle cristene menn, swa swa us sylfe.\n& uton beon mildheorte earmum mannum & el\u00feeodigum & untrumum, \u00fe\u00e6t us ure dryhten \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6t\n& \u00feeah ure hwylc wi\u00f0 o\u00f0erne agylte, o\u00f0\u00f0e on worde o\u00f0\u00f0e o worce, forbere he him bli\u00f0lice & forgyfe\n& uto ne georwenan us \u00feeah we \u00feearle wi\u00f0 God \u00e6lmihtigne agylt h\u00e6bben, ac uton \u00e6lcum timan his\n& uton a his willan wyrcan, & uton beon so\u00f0f\u00e6ste & mildheorte & rummode & rihtwise &\n& uton habban us symle so\u00f0e lufe betweonan, & uton efstan to \u00f0am heofonlican rice & hit geearnian\n\u00de\u00e6r is leoht ealles leohtes, \u00fe\u00e6r is se eca gefea, \u00fe\u00e6r is seo ece torhtnes eallra engla, \u00fe\u00e6r is seo swete\n\u00de\u00e6r wunia\u00fe \u00fea haligan menn him sylfe & rihtwise & \u00fea unwemman & \u00fea godan & \u00fea ge\u00fewearan &\n\u00de\u00e6r heria\u00fe englas & heahenglas \u00feone ecan dryhten, \u00feone arwur\u00f0ia\u00f0 witigan & Petrus & Paulus &",
